    "Software Details": "Software Details",
    "The Marketing Module in eCommerceGo SaaS is designed to revolutionize the way you promote your business. With its robust features, you can easily activate, generate, and modify business cards to suit your brand's needs. Whether you're a new business owner or looking to refresh your brand's image, this module provides you with the flexibility to design business cards that truly represent your company's identity.": "The Marketing Module in eCommerceGo SaaS is designed to revolutionize the way you promote your business. With its robust features, you can easily activate, generate, and modify business cards to suit your brand's needs. Whether you're a new business owner or looking to refresh your brand's image, this module provides you with the flexibility to design business cards that truly represent your company's identity.",
    "View Live Demo": "View Live Demo",
    "Enhance Your Business Reach with the Marketing Module": "Enhance Your Business Reach with the Marketing Module",
    "Boost your sales with our powerful marketing module, designed to streamline campaigns, track performance, and drive growth effortlessly": "Boost your sales with our powerful marketing module, designed to streamline campaigns, track performance, and drive growth effortlessly",
    "Create and Edit Your Business Profile with Ease": "Create and Edit Your Business Profile with Ease",
    "Starting a new business or managing multiple brands? The Marketing Module offers seamless options for creating new business profiles and editing them as your needs evolve. This flexibility ensures that your business information is always up to date, keeping your brand relevant in a competitive market. The module’s user-friendly interface makes it simple to add or update contact details, logos, and promotional messages, ensuring your brand always looks professional.": "Starting a new business or managing multiple brands? The Marketing Module offers seamless options for creating new business profiles and editing them as your needs evolve. This flexibility ensures that your business information is always up to date, keeping your brand relevant in a competitive market. The module’s user-friendly interface makes it simple to add or update contact details, logos, and promotional messages, ensuring your brand always looks professional.",
    "Choose from a Variety of Business Themes": "Choose from a Variety of Business Themes",
    "The Marketing Module also offers a range of customizable business themes to enhance your brand’s presentation. Whether you’re looking for something sleek and modern or classic and traditional, you can select from various themes that best align with your brand’s personality. Each theme is designed to maximize visual appeal and ensure consistency across all your marketing materials, helping you create a cohesive brand experience for your audience.": "The Marketing Module also offers a range of customizable business themes to enhance your brand’s presentation. Whether you’re looking for something sleek and modern or classic and traditional, you can select from various themes that best align with your brand’s personality. Each theme is designed to maximize visual appeal and ensure consistency across all your marketing materials, helping you create a cohesive brand experience for your audience.",
    "Drive Growth with Customizable Marketing Campaigns": "Drive Growth with Customizable Marketing Campaigns",
